{"real": true, "dur": 84.7, "sent": [{"start": 0.22, "end": 5.38, "text": "Let me take one situation from start to finish, so you can see how it all fits.", "words": [{"w": "Let", "s": 0.22}, {"w": "me", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "take", "s": 0.6}, {"w": "one", "s": 0.82}, {"w": "situation", "s": 1.02}, {"w": "from", "s": 1.74}, {"w": "start", "s": 2.04}, {"w": "to", "s": 2.38}, {"w": "finish,", "s": 2.6}, {"w": "so", "s": 3.52}, {"w": "you", "s": 3.76}, {"w": "can", "s": 3.88}, {"w": "see", "s": 4.12}, {"w": "how", "s": 4.4}, {"w": "it", "s": 4.62}, {"w": "all", "s": 4.82}, {"w": "fits.", "s": 5.06}]}, {"start": 6.14, "end": 7.66, "text": "We’re in French Unit 2.", "words": [{"w": "We’re", "s": 6.14}, {"w": "in", "s": 6.38}, {"w": "French", "s": 6.58}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 7.06}, {"w": "2.", "s": 7.6}]}, {"start": 8.34, "end": 10.48, "text": "The situation is saying what you like.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 8.34}, {"w": "situation", "s": 8.48}, {"w": "is", "s": 9.22}, {"w": "saying", "s": 9.38}, {"w": "what", "s": 9.76}, {"w": "you", "s": 10.02}, {"w": "like.", "s": 10.16}]}, {"start": 11.14, "end": 12.78, "text": "You can see the French title here.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 11.14}, {"w": "can", "s": 11.24}, {"w": "see", "s": 11.46}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.66}, {"w": "French", "s": 11.78}, {"w": "title", "s": 12.14}, {"w": "here.", "s": 12.56}]}, {"start": 13.24, "end": 21.16, "text": "First, learners work through the linguistic goals using the three-star progression and Bonus you’ve just seen.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 13.24}, {"w": "learners", "s": 14.4}, {"w": "work", "s": 14.96}, {"w": "through", "s": 15.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 15.82}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 15.94}, {"w": "goals", "s": 16.64}, {"w": "using", "s": 17.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.96}, {"w": "three-star", "s": 18.12}, {"w": "progression", "s": 18.7}, {"w": "and", "s": 19.74}, {"w": "Bonus", "s": 19.9}, {"w": "you’ve", "s": 20.38}, {"w": "just", "s": 20.6}, {"w": "seen.", "s": 20.86}]}, {"start": 21.92, "end": 25.52, "text": "On the left is the exercise tab from my original page.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 21.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 22.04}, {"w": "left", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "is", "s": 22.84}, {"w": "the", "s": 22.98}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 23.12}, {"w": "tab", "s": 23.78}, {"w": "from", "s": 24.28}, {"w": "my", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "original", "s": 24.6}, {"w": "page.", "s": 25.14}]}, {"start": 26.04, "end": 32.14, "text": "Once they have the language they need, learners practise the situation in four different ways.", "words": [{"w": "Once", "s": 26.04}, {"w": "they", "s": 26.28}, {"w": "have", "s": 26.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.64}, {"w": "language", "s": 26.78}, {"w": "they", "s": 27.2}, {"w": "need,", "s": 27.4}, {"w": "learners", "s": 28.32}, {"w": "practise", "s": 28.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.7}, {"w": "situation", "s": 29.82}, {"w": "in", "s": 30.88}, {"w": "four", "s": 31.1}, {"w": "different", "s": 31.36}, {"w": "ways.", "s": 31.7}]}, {"start": 32.78, "end": 35.28, "text": "In ÉcouTexte, they listen to it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 32.78}, {"w": "Eh-ku-tekst,", "s": 33.02}, {"w": "they", "s": 34.18}, {"w": "listen", "s": 34.42}, {"w": "to", "s": 34.88}, {"w": "it.", "s": 35.08}]}, {"start": 35.86, "end": 49.8, "text": "Next, in G-Compris, which means “I understood,” they read a short everyday document, like the message on the right, and answer questions that check what the course has actually taught.", "words": [{"w": "Next,", "s": 35.86}, {"w": "in", "s": 36.52}, {"w": "Zhay-kom-pree,", "s": 36.72}, {"w": "which", "s": 37.9}, {"w": "means", "s": 38.18}, {"w": "“I", "s": 38.56}, {"w": "understood,”", "s": 39.44}, {"w": "they", "s": 40.4}, {"w": "read", "s": 40.64}, {"w": "a", "s": 40.96}, {"w": "short", "s": 41.16}, {"w": "everyday", "s": 41.68}, {"w": "document,", "s": 42.22}, {"w": "like", "s": 43.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.5}, {"w": "message", "s": 43.66}, {"w": "on", "s": 44.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 44.3}, {"w": "right,", "s": 44.44}, {"w": "and", "s": 45.5}, {"w": "answer", "s": 45.82}, {"w": "questions", "s": 46.28}, {"w": "that", "s": 47.26}, {"w": "check", "s": 47.48}, {"w": "what", "s": 47.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.0}, {"w": "course", "s": 48.2}, {"w": "has", "s": 48.6}, {"w": "actually", "s": 48.94}, {"w": "taught.", "s": 49.42}]}, {"start": 50.32, "end": 54.0, "text": "In other words, spotting a matching word won’t get you through.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 50.32}, {"w": "other", "s": 50.54}, {"w": "words,", "s": 50.8}, {"w": "spotting", "s": 51.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "matching", "s": 52.12}, {"w": "word", "s": 52.52}, {"w": "won’t", "s": 53.06}, {"w": "get", "s": 53.36}, {"w": "you", "s": 53.56}, {"w": "through.", "s": 53.72}]}, {"start": 54.86, "end": 58.0, "text": "After that, in WorDrill, they say it out loud.", "words": [{"w": "After", "s": 54.86}, {"w": "that,", "s": 55.16}, {"w": "in", "s": 55.72}, {"w": "WorDrill,", "s": 55.92}, {"w": "they", "s": 56.96}, {"w": "say", "s": 57.16}, {"w": "it", "s": 57.32}, {"w": "out", "s": 57.48}, {"w": "loud.", "s": 57.68}]}, {"start": 58.62, "end": 62.68, "text": "And in ComposeIt, they write a few lines of their own and get feedback.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 58.62}, {"w": "in", "s": 58.86}, {"w": "ComposeIt,", "s": 59.04}, {"w": "they", "s": 59.92}, {"w": "write", "s": 60.1}, {"w": "a", "s": 60.4}, {"w": "few", "s": 60.52}, {"w": "lines", "s": 60.74}, {"w": "of", "s": 61.1}, {"w": "their", "s": 61.22}, {"w": "own", "s": 61.42}, {"w": "and", "s": 61.78}, {"w": "get", "s": 61.96}, {"w": "feedback.", "s": 62.18}]}, {"start": 63.0, "end": 70.16, "text": "Finally, at the end of the unit, there’s the Mission: planning a weekend outing together.", "words": [{"w": "Finally,", "s": 63.0}, {"w": "at", "s": 64.06}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.2}, {"w": "end", "s": 64.42}, {"w": "of", "s": 64.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.78}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 64.94}, {"w": "there’s", "s": 65.84}, {"w": "the", "s": 66.14}, {"w": "Mission:", "s": 66.26}, {"w": "planning", "s": 67.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 68.16}, {"w": "weekend", "s": 68.28}, {"w": "outing", "s": 69.14}, {"w": "together.", "s": 69.68}]}, {"start": 71.24, "end": 76.26, "text": "Unlike the four activities, it uses every situation in the unit.", "words": [{"w": "Unlike", "s": 71.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 71.72}, {"w": "four", "s": 71.9}, {"w": "activities,", "s": 72.16}, {"w": "it", "s": 73.36}, {"w": "uses", "s": 73.64}, {"w": "every", "s": 74.34}, {"w": "situation", "s": 74.68}, {"w": "in", "s": 75.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 75.74}, {"w": "unit.", "s": 75.9}]}, {"start": 76.78, "end": 80.52, "text": "All along, on the map, learners see each step in order.", "words": [{"w": "All", "s": 76.78}, {"w": "along,", "s": 76.98}, {"w": "on", "s": 77.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 77.94}, {"w": "map,", "s": 78.06}, {"w": "learners", "s": 78.68}, {"w": "see", "s": 79.14}, {"w": "each", "s": 79.5}, {"w": "step", "s": 79.76}, {"w": "in", "s": 80.04}, {"w": "order.", "s": 80.22}]}, {"start": 81.04, "end": 84.02, "text": "That way, everything follows the same learning path.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 81.04}, {"w": "way,", "s": 81.24}, {"w": "everything", "s": 81.98}, {"w": "follows", "s": 82.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 82.94}, {"w": "same", "s": 83.12}, {"w": "learning", "s": 83.38}, {"w": "path.", "s": 83.72}]}]}